WEBVTT

00:12.340 --> 00:14.430
<i>I am a cat.</i>

00:16.070 --> 00:21.000
<i>However, I am no normal cat.</i>

00:33.240 --> 00:35.220
<i>I am...</i>

00:40.250 --> 00:42.180
<i>the most masterful of cats.</i>

00:45.510 --> 00:47.940
<i>A masterful cat knows.</i>

00:55.340 --> 01:00.550
Yukichi! Your master's home!

01:02.460 --> 01:06.040
Huh? Are you already asleep?

01:06.600 --> 01:08.610
Yukichi?

01:08.610 --> 01:10.580
Hey, Yukichi.

01:10.580 --> 01:11.800
Hey!

01:12.880 --> 01:15.260
<i>One needs money to survive!</i>

01:16.920 --> 01:22.470
<i>That's why humans go to a place 
called a company to work...</i>

01:22.980 --> 01:24.430
<i>And with the money they earn...</i>

01:24.810 --> 01:28.690
<b>Cat Dash</b>

01:25.660 --> 01:27.850
<i>Cat cans are obtained.</i>

01:29.300 --> 01:32.090
<i>In other words, I must have my human work</i>

01:32.090 --> 01:34.550
<i>and make sure she earns plenty of money...</i>

01:37.810 --> 01:40.320
<i>Or we'll straight-up die from starvation!</i>

01:41.280 --> 01:44.950
<i>However, it's quite lamentable that...</i>

01:45.720 --> 01:50.750
<i>my master is a completely 
worthless human being.</i>

01:53.160 --> 01:56.510
<i>It's sad, but this is fate.</i>

02:12.630 --> 02:13.860
<i>However...</i>

02:15.110 --> 02:18.360
<i>I made my decision that day.</i>

02:34.780 --> 02:36.630
<i>On that snowy night...</i>

02:43.290 --> 02:50.140
<i>If this human hadn't taken me home, 
I would not have remained in this world.</i>

02:55.980 --> 02:57.970
<i>Even if...</i>

02:57.970 --> 03:01.310
Okay! This is your new home from now on!

03:01.310 --> 03:04.910
<i>...she's the type of human 
whose home is filled with trash!</i>

03:08.110 --> 03:11.960
Yukichi, let me rub your belly...

03:11.960 --> 03:18.050
<i>Even if she's the type of human 
who drools as she passes out!</i>

03:19.360 --> 03:20.740
<i>I made my decision.</i>

03:22.290 --> 03:27.790
<i>I will use the full extent of my magnificent 
skills and wisdom as a masterful cat...</i>

03:35.580 --> 03:37.960
<i>to ensure tomorrow's cat can!</i>

03:41.060 --> 03:44.150
<i>This exasperatingly worthless human</i>

03:45.470 --> 03:48.240
<i>must stay healthy for that very reason.</i>

03:57.500 --> 04:01.400
Yukichi... Another beer...

04:07.850 --> 04:10.900
Yukichi, you're heavy...

04:10.900 --> 04:13.060
I-I'm gonna die!

04:29.870 --> 04:36.960
<b>The Masterful Cat
Is Depressed Again Today</b>

05:43.980 --> 05:47.650
Can

05:43.980 --> 05:47.650
<b>The Masterful Cat Has Grown Big</b>

05:47.780 --> 05:48.990
<b>The Masterful Cat Has Grown Big</b>

05:47.860 --> 05:48.990
Can

06:11.540 --> 06:13.170
So cute!

06:13.170 --> 06:15.880
It's a picture of Yukichi 
when he was a kitten!

06:16.570 --> 06:18.080
It's already been three years, huh?

06:18.080 --> 06:19.770
Isn't that right?

06:23.270 --> 06:26.570
Yukichi! We need to talk.

06:39.070 --> 06:42.200
I keep missing the right 
moment to bring this up.

06:42.200 --> 06:43.790
Yukichi...

06:44.210 --> 06:46.690
Why'd you grow so big?

06:47.420 --> 06:49.770
You're more like the size of a bear now!

06:50.880 --> 06:52.260
Hey!

06:52.260 --> 06:54.280
Where are you going, Yukichi?!

06:57.190 --> 06:57.930
No!

06:57.930 --> 07:00.560
I'm not worried that you're too fat!

07:00.850 --> 07:07.150
I don't know if your body fat percentage 
could even be compared with other cats...

07:08.890 --> 07:12.950
I mean, I never had a cat before.

07:13.320 --> 07:17.540
That's why I thought you were 
a bit bigger than expected...

07:17.540 --> 07:20.290
But I don't think your size is normal!

07:20.970 --> 07:25.420
First of all, I don't think normal cats 
can cook, clean, and do laundry.

07:25.970 --> 07:30.420
I don't think they make lunches 
or take out the trash, either!

07:30.750 --> 07:33.640
You always check the weather and 
make sure I have an umbrella, too!

07:33.640 --> 07:35.860
And you keep the tub warm for me!

07:35.860 --> 07:39.740
And a lot of other things! 
Uh, so, in other words...

07:40.480 --> 07:43.900
Thank you for always taking care of me!

07:44.880 --> 07:45.900
I got off track!

07:46.270 --> 07:51.030
D-Do you know the reason 
why you got so big, Yukichi?

07:53.780 --> 07:55.030
Yukichi?

07:55.810 --> 07:58.040
<i>Thanks, Yukichi...</i>

08:02.970 --> 08:05.000
I'm really thankful.

08:07.620 --> 08:10.210
Thank goodness I have you, Yukichi.

08:13.300 --> 08:14.960
Hey, Yukichi?

08:17.660 --> 08:19.140
I see.

08:19.140 --> 08:20.320
I wonder why?

08:20.320 --> 08:23.910
I tried searching the internet, 
but I couldn't figure it out either!

08:25.360 --> 08:28.190
Well, I guess we'll just never know.

08:28.760 --> 08:30.190
It's probably fine.

08:30.190 --> 08:33.010
We've been living together 
just fine until now.

08:33.620 --> 08:37.720
It's probably not a big deal 
that the chief met you...

08:41.500 --> 08:43.660
I met him before.

08:45.930 --> 08:49.090
<i>Now that I think about it, 
the chief was really calm about it.</i>

08:49.470 --> 08:53.590
<i>He didn't act like he saw 
an impossibly large cat.</i>

08:53.950 --> 08:59.300
<i>I don't remember it, but he might've 
visited my place when Yukichi was a kitten.</i>

09:01.860 --> 09:06.310
<i>So he visited this place soon 
after I picked up Yukichi?</i>

09:07.840 --> 09:09.800
No way!

09:09.360 --> 09:12.900
<b>G-Korori</b>

09:10.370 --> 09:12.900
What should I do, Yukichi?!

09:12.900 --> 09:16.090
Is there any way to erase 
a person's memories?

09:16.090 --> 09:19.830
The chief might've visited before!

09:19.830 --> 09:23.650
Here! Around the time I picked you up!

09:31.450 --> 09:33.340
Welcome to my humble abode!

09:38.090 --> 09:39.550
Yukichi!

09:39.550 --> 09:42.310
Don't collapse just from thinking about it!

09:43.500 --> 09:46.960
You know, I really did feel bad about it.

09:46.960 --> 09:53.980
This place was... a little... 
pretty... super messy...

09:55.410 --> 09:59.700
I'm sorry! It was a completely trashed house!

10:00.790 --> 10:05.980
Maybe you were infected with an unknown 
bacterium produced by the sea of garbage here

10:05.980 --> 10:07.500
and it made you a giant mutant?!

10:07.790 --> 10:09.000
<b>Meow</b>

10:07.850 --> 10:08.600
Ouch.

10:13.420 --> 10:16.270
It's useless now. 
I can't show my face at work now.

10:16.270 --> 10:19.410
I don't think I'll be able to talk 
with the chief normally anymore.

10:20.020 --> 10:22.180
Of all people, why Chief Orizuka?!

10:22.180 --> 10:24.820
Did you know there are rumors he has OCD?

10:24.820 --> 10:26.220
No! No! No!

10:26.990 --> 10:29.730
What kind of person did 
he see me as until now?!

10:30.270 --> 10:31.560
No way.

10:31.560 --> 10:33.520
I'm going to die from embarrassment...

10:40.700 --> 10:42.370
Cheers!

10:43.080 --> 10:44.990
Yeah! You're right!

10:44.990 --> 10:47.810
It's too late to worry about it! Let's drink!

10:56.340 --> 11:00.180
She was given alcohol until
she forgot all about it...

11:00.470 --> 11:01.970
<b>G-Korori</b>

11:00.560 --> 11:01.970
No!

11:01.970 --> 11:03.510
Don't hunt it, Yukichi!

11:03.510 --> 11:05.430
Don't tear it apart and eat it!

11:05.430 --> 11:08.920
But do something about it quickly!

11:08.390 --> 11:12.980
A cat that has to use bug spray
because his owner freaks out
if he smashes them...

11:25.910 --> 11:27.790
I want to eat meat!

11:27.790 --> 11:28.510
Hm?

11:28.510 --> 11:30.390
This one!

11:30.390 --> 11:31.380
No.

11:32.650 --> 11:33.620
Mama!

11:34.170 --> 11:37.430
What should we have for dinner tonight?

11:37.430 --> 11:38.350
Huh?

11:43.290 --> 11:44.930
<i>A bear?! No, a cat?!</i>

11:44.930 --> 11:46.760
<i>No way. I must be tired.</i>

11:46.760 --> 11:48.810
<i>I'm so tired I'm seeing things?!</i>

11:58.320 --> 12:01.320
<i>People will think I'm crazy 
if I make a fuss here!</i>

12:01.690 --> 12:06.290
<i>There's no way a cat would stand around 
comparing the weights of cabbages!</i>

12:07.440 --> 12:08.740
<i>And most of all...</i>

12:09.370 --> 12:11.760
<i>Why is it wearing a Japanese apron?!</i>

12:11.750 --> 12:16.500
He's wearing it as a "sanitary apron"
to politely prevent the shedding
 of his fur within the store.

12:17.260 --> 12:19.090
Manager!

12:19.650 --> 12:24.040
That cat is here again. What should I do?

12:24.040 --> 12:24.720
What?!

12:24.720 --> 12:27.050
<b>Rio
Manager</b>

12:25.280 --> 12:27.920
As a manager, I need to have 
a proper talk with him!

12:27.920 --> 12:29.390
You're so impressive, Manager.

12:29.950 --> 12:31.300
Dear customer!

12:33.170 --> 12:34.440
Customer?

12:37.560 --> 12:40.900
Thank you for your regular patronage!

12:46.460 --> 12:49.180
His toe beans were super squishy!

12:49.180 --> 12:51.510
Does that mean he's allowed 
to shop in the store?

12:51.510 --> 12:52.370
Of course!

12:53.500 --> 12:55.460
<b>Half Price</b>

12:55.460 --> 13:00.460
<i>This is why the manager 
is bad at increasing sales.</i>

13:00.830 --> 13:03.490
<i>It's just a guy in a cat suit.</i>

13:03.490 --> 13:06.220
<i>I hope the customers 
don't complain about him.</i>

13:10.310 --> 13:12.720
<i>His movements are really life-like.</i>

13:13.110 --> 13:15.280
<i>Where does he hide the zipper?</i>

13:16.760 --> 13:19.690
I'm v-very sorry for staring!

13:19.690 --> 13:23.070
Um, did you sew that yourself?

13:26.010 --> 13:27.820
No! Not that!

13:27.820 --> 13:30.160
Well, it's pretty amazing 
you made that yourself, too!

13:31.020 --> 13:32.990
<i>He throws me off...</i>

13:33.320 --> 13:35.620
<i>Even though he's just 
a weirdo in a cat suit.</i>

13:36.600 --> 13:39.990
Your total will be 2,560 yen.

13:39.990 --> 13:42.670
Please show me your point card 
if you have one.

13:43.350 --> 13:46.300
Oh, we're providing samples 
of the newest Churu sticks

13:46.300 --> 13:48.680
to customers who buy canned cat food.

13:48.680 --> 13:50.680
Would you like some?

13:55.280 --> 13:57.600
<i>He looks so happy, like it's for himself.</i>

13:58.440 --> 14:01.020
<i>This weirdo really throws me off...</i>

14:01.970 --> 14:04.650
Please come again.

14:12.440 --> 14:15.040
Manager, I'm heading out now.

14:15.040 --> 14:16.210
Whoa. Seriously?

14:16.210 --> 14:18.790
He's just laughing to himself. Gross.

14:18.790 --> 14:20.870
Oh! Good work today, Rio.

14:20.870 --> 14:22.180
Don't call me gross!

14:22.180 --> 14:24.000
I'm reading the survey responses!

14:24.000 --> 14:25.490
Here! Take a look!

14:25.920 --> 14:28.430
<b>Guest Survey
 The kitty was super cute.
 I wanna shop here again.</b>

14:28.430 --> 14:31.660
I wonder if that cat would 
work as a part-timer.

14:31.660 --> 14:34.430
No idea. Have a good night.

14:34.770 --> 14:36.830
You're so cold!

14:51.210 --> 14:55.450
Hold on a sec! Why are you staring like that?

14:55.850 --> 14:57.450
Is there something there?!

14:57.450 --> 14:58.940
Hey, Yukichi.

14:58.940 --> 15:00.520
Is it a bug, Yukichi?!

15:04.100 --> 15:06.750
What's the huge sigh for?

15:04.380 --> 15:07.170
He noticed the area he just cleaned
was already dirty with grease...

15:16.290 --> 15:18.220
This is Fukuzawa from 
the business department.

15:18.630 --> 15:21.440
We've gotten approval from the venue.

15:21.440 --> 15:22.310
Yes.

15:25.220 --> 15:28.300
I will send you all 
the details in a single file.

15:28.690 --> 15:29.820
Yes.

15:29.820 --> 15:31.700
Please confirm the information 
once it arrives.

15:33.200 --> 15:34.950
Saku-senpai!

15:34.950 --> 15:38.430
Company D asked to reschedule <i>now</i>!

15:38.430 --> 15:39.700
Let me see.

15:39.700 --> 15:42.880
Yes. I understand.

15:44.620 --> 15:46.970
Okay. Perfect.

15:46.970 --> 15:50.960
You're even faster at work than usual today.

15:51.320 --> 15:54.860
It's probably because I got 
a lot of rest this weekend.

15:57.120 --> 15:59.670
<i>I feel like I've forgotten 
something, though...</i>

15:59.670 --> 16:01.410
Oh, Orizuka-kun.

16:02.620 --> 16:04.860
Welcome back from Kyoto.

16:04.860 --> 16:06.350
I just returned.

16:06.780 --> 16:11.110
Excuse me, General Manager. 
May I borrow Fukuzawa now?

16:12.020 --> 16:14.740
Fukuzawa, thank you 
for taking care of Company D.

16:15.510 --> 16:20.750
I have a meeting right after this, so 
you and Shibasaki should go ahead and...

16:19.170 --> 16:20.750
<i>What should I do, Yukichi?!</i>

16:20.750 --> 16:24.350
The chief might've visited before!

16:26.270 --> 16:29.380
<i>I didn't want to remember!</i>

16:37.720 --> 16:39.840
<i>A-Awkward!</i>

16:39.840 --> 16:41.720
<i>Super awkward!</i>

16:41.720 --> 16:45.040
<i>I wish I could just disappear! 
I want to go home!</i>

16:45.040 --> 16:49.440
<i>He's going to think I'm a weirdo 
and the owner of a dirty apartment!</i>

16:51.950 --> 16:56.160
<i>I want to go home and eat 
Yukichi's gyoza and drink some beer.</i>

16:55.860 --> 16:57.950
Escape.

16:56.160 --> 16:58.220
<i>I'll have ramen as a finisher.</i>

16:58.870 --> 17:00.160
About the estimate last week...

17:00.940 --> 17:03.360
A large serving of roast pork?! 
Sounds good!

17:04.160 --> 17:08.840
No, I was talking about the estimate 
for Company C last week.

17:08.840 --> 17:09.900
Huh?

17:09.900 --> 17:12.920
You managed it right before the deadline, 
and it helped tremendously.

17:13.590 --> 17:17.400
There were no mistakes in the calculations, 
and the client was very satisfied.

17:17.400 --> 17:19.650
We got the contract smoothly because of you.

17:20.410 --> 17:22.520
When you first joined, 
you always kept your eyes down.

17:22.970 --> 17:28.720
I didn't think you'd be very dependable, 
but you're completely different now.

17:28.720 --> 17:29.520
Huh?

17:29.940 --> 17:32.790
H-Have I really changed that much?

17:32.790 --> 17:36.030
Yeah. Your complexion is a lot better, too.

17:36.690 --> 17:38.490
Is it all thanks to that cat?

17:39.740 --> 17:41.950
No!

17:40.110 --> 17:41.950
Huh? What's going on?!

17:42.650 --> 17:45.010
Wh-What was that for?

17:45.010 --> 17:48.080
Ch-Ch-Ch-Chief, you really do know about my cat.

17:49.230 --> 17:52.380
When? When did you visit my place?

17:52.980 --> 17:54.840
You don't remember?

17:56.100 --> 17:57.380
No.

17:57.950 --> 18:01.060
Let me say this first. 
I didn't go because I wanted to.

18:06.830 --> 18:09.150
A little after you started working here,

18:09.150 --> 18:13.160
I happened to see you completely 
drunk at a pub on the way home.

18:13.160 --> 18:16.240
When I asked you if you 
could make it home so drunk...

18:16.570 --> 18:21.370
You vomited, and I was kicked 
out of the pub with you.

18:21.720 --> 18:22.450
Shall I continue?

18:22.450 --> 18:26.790
Chief! Please give me thirty seconds 
to breathe and center myself!

18:27.630 --> 18:30.310
<i>He waited thirty seconds.</i>

18:32.040 --> 18:34.690
I ended up taking you home...

18:35.960 --> 18:37.010
Hey, don't fall asleep!

18:37.010 --> 18:38.720
We're here. Where's your key?

18:38.720 --> 18:40.050
Is someone home?

18:40.050 --> 18:41.780
Yeah!

18:41.780 --> 18:43.180
Then, I'll ring the doorbell.

18:43.180 --> 18:45.910
I have a cute cat!

18:45.910 --> 18:47.060
A pet?

18:48.980 --> 18:51.020
Looks like we need the key.

18:51.020 --> 18:52.400
Okay!

18:54.790 --> 18:57.820
Um? Where's my bag?

18:57.820 --> 18:59.180
Hey, now...

19:10.250 --> 19:13.240
<i>Did the cat just open the door?</i>

19:13.680 --> 19:15.300
<i>No way...</i>

19:15.300 --> 19:17.670
<i>Fukuzawa-san must have 
forgotten to lock her door.</i>

19:18.200 --> 19:20.820
I'm home, Yukichi!

19:21.430 --> 19:22.430
<b>Meow</b>

19:21.900 --> 19:25.080
Ouch! You hit me!

19:25.080 --> 19:27.020
Why'd you do that?

19:27.020 --> 19:28.730
<i>Did the cat just...?!</i>

19:29.420 --> 19:31.770
<i>I must be pretty drunk myself...</i>

19:32.350 --> 19:34.330
<i>I should go home and sleep.</i>

19:35.290 --> 19:36.760
And that's what happened.

19:36.760 --> 19:39.900
I wish you told me about all of this sooner.

19:39.900 --> 19:41.160
You never asked about it.

19:41.160 --> 19:43.530
I don't remember it at all.

19:45.420 --> 19:48.040
B-But, according to what you said...

19:48.500 --> 19:52.170
Y-You only saw the entryway 
before you went home, right?

19:52.830 --> 19:56.170
I mean, you didn't see anything inside?

20:02.690 --> 20:03.960
Don't worry.

20:03.960 --> 20:07.810
No man would get any ideas about doing 
anything to you in a place full of trash.

20:08.750 --> 20:11.560
<i>He definitely saw!</i>

20:12.170 --> 20:16.980
I know it's late, but please 
allow me to make it up to you!

20:17.420 --> 20:18.810
There's no need.

20:18.810 --> 20:21.740
I was just a superior taking care of 
one of my subordinates. That's all.

20:21.740 --> 20:27.600
Please let me do something. 
I'll even run errands for you!

20:27.600 --> 20:28.950
Errands?

20:28.950 --> 20:31.240
I don't feel comfortable doing nothing!

20:31.240 --> 20:33.040
Oh, that's right. This month...

20:33.560 --> 20:35.790
Then can I ask for a favor?

20:36.180 --> 20:38.940
O-Of course! What can I do?

20:40.620 --> 20:45.050
I want you to go to the aquarium with me 
on the last Sunday of the month.

20:50.680 --> 20:51.630
Huh?

20:53.540 --> 20:55.100
I'm home, Yukichi!

20:55.100 --> 20:56.600
Oh, I'm not hungry yet.

20:56.600 --> 20:58.230
I'll wash up first.

20:58.230 --> 21:01.070
And, I'm going to go out 
on the last Sunday of the month.

21:02.310 --> 21:05.430
Why are you so surprised 
I'd have plans on the weekend?

21:05.430 --> 21:10.540
Well, somehow I ended up agreeing 
to go to the aquarium with my chief

21:12.820 --> 21:17.040
The sea slug idol group UMYU-Sea 
is having a live event there.

21:19.740 --> 21:21.710
What? You know about them, Yukichi?!

21:21.710 --> 21:23.790
Are they famous? You have a favorite?!

21:23.790 --> 21:25.400
Which one?

21:24.340 --> 21:27.300
Searching Youtubo.

21:25.400 --> 21:27.300
Th-This is a surprise...

21:28.150 --> 21:31.590
<i>He asked for Sea Bunny-chan merch.</i>

21:33.640 --> 21:36.980
I lost again!

23:06.940 --> 23:30.300
<b>Next Episode</b>

23:07.770 --> 23:10.630
<i>I am a masterful cat.</i>

23:11.070 --> 23:13.330
<i>A masterful cat knows.</i>

23:14.120 --> 23:18.040
<i>You should boost your immune 
system to prevent colds.</i>

23:18.540 --> 23:22.580
<i>So adding foods with 
vitamin C and vitamin A,</i>

23:22.580 --> 23:24.730
<i>like carrots and broccoli, is good for you.</i>

23:25.260 --> 23:28.340
<i>But the most important thing 
is getting proper sleep.</i>

23:29.330 --> 23:33.460
<i>Next episode: "A Masterful 
Cat Is Good at Giving Care."</i>

23:30.300 --> 23:36.970
Can

23:30.300 --> 23:36.970
<b>A Masterful Cat Is Good at Giving Care</b>

23:33.460 --> 23:35.810
<i>What a troublesome owner.</i>
